From 00d263a0c9f7e1c248c45689cbd366a876c82450 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sandeep Kumar <sandeepkumar.sanku@amd.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:54:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] LogEntry: Add support for parsing and presenting CPER
 interface data

- Added fetching of CPERProcessed interface properties on
  event log entries
- Added support for fetching CPER raw data using CPERRaw interface

Tested:
- Qemu tests passed on target platform
- Passed local CI docker run for bmcweb unit tests

Change-Id: Ibc406ea0b81243e3563fbc99586dc934f7498c86
Signed-off-by: Sandeep Kumar <sandeepkumar.sanku@amd.com>
